{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13108180","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13108180","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1310818001:0":{"text":"这里真的很奇怪，好像吹来的风里都有刀剑碰撞和战马冲锋的声音！","source_cn":"这里真的很奇怪，好像吹来的风里都有刀剑碰撞和战马冲锋的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4327E971715310CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1310818002:1":{"text":"这是最后的战场，这里埋葬过太多的尸骨，多到铁与血的意志直到现在都消散不去……","source_cn":"这是最后的战场，这里埋葬过太多的尸骨，多到铁与血的意志...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C850EBE774560B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310818003:0":{"text":"那时，我就是死在这里……","source_cn":"那时，我就是死在这里……<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE57D9F5E2D49C877","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310818004:0":{"text":"瓦丽卡，你所有的战友都失去理智，成为活死人了吗？","source_cn":"瓦丽卡，你所有的战友都失去理智，成为活死人了吗？<ke...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7177B99BD03E259","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310818005:1":{"text":"是的，几乎所有。还有些人仍旧努力保持着最后的理智，但……或许也坚持不了多久了。","source_cn":"是的，几乎所有。还有些人仍旧努力保持着最后的理智，但…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98CEA6608A2A9E0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","d